Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 09:44:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sidebar): merge same-owner project rows and omit
 redundant machine headings [daveey]

Merge same-owner declared and synthetic project rows using retained folders
and owner/profile/session identity. Preserve authoritative mixed-owner membership
and omit redundant headings for singleton machine groups. Regression coverage
checks duplicate nodes/counts, headings and limited membership. No live window
interaction or deployment is claimed.

